{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
  "Enable location": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "开启位置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Open Settings": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "打开设置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep your city up to date": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "让城市信息保持最新"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Turn on location to spot friends in the same city.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "开启位置，发现与你同城的好友。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose a city or airport": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择城市或机场"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Name your trip": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "为行程起个名字"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Optional": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "可选"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep the name to 60 characters or fewer.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "行程名称请勿超过 60 个字符。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose the start and end dates.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择开始和结束日期。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "See where your friends are headed.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "看看好友接下来去哪儿。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Add a city and your dates.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "填上城市和日期。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your friends’ shared plans will appear here.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "好友分享的计划会显示在这里。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Review your plan before saving.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "确认你的计划后再保存。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Selected friends can browse your city and dates.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "所选好友可以查看你的城市和日期。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Selected friends see matching dates only when you share plans with each other.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "双方互相分享计划时，所选好友才能看到重叠日期。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Get a reminder up to 14 days before your plans overlap.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "在计划重叠前的 14 天内收到提醒。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Share with the friends you choose": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "分享给你选择的好友"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Allow location access to update your city automatically.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "允许访问位置，即可自动更新城市。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Updated %@": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "更新于 %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Send a friend request to connect.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "发送好友请求，与对方建立联系。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your city.\nYour choice.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "你的城市。\n由你做主。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose who sees your city. Pause sharing anytime.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择把城市分享给谁，随时可以暂停。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Start with your city.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "从你所在的城市开始。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "What you share and save": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "你分享和保存的信息"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep your city up to date as you travel.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "旅途中，自动更新你所在的城市。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose what appears on your widgets.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择小组件显示哪些内容。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Hide names and cities.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "隐藏姓名和城市。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Applies to Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "适用于主屏幕和锁屏小组件。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "See what you share and what the app saves.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "了解你分享的内容，以及 App 保存的信息。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your friends’ latest shared cities": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "好友最近分享的城市"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your account data is deleted and you’re signed out": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "删除账号数据并退出登录"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Sign in to connect with your friends.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "登录，与好友保持联系。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Example itinerary": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "示例行程"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Airport routes": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "机场间航线"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your flight": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "你的航班"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your flight · demo": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "你的航班 · 演示"
        }
      }
    }
  },


  "Widget content hidden": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "已隐藏小组件内容"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Past city update": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "历史城市动态"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose who to message.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择发给谁。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Demo mode · sample data": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "演示模式 · 示例数据"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Hide names and details": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "隐藏姓名和详情"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Different cities.\nStill close.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "各在一城。\n依然亲近。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A little nudge.\nA real-life reunion.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "一个提醒。\n一次相聚。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your next trip,\ntogether.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "下一次旅行，\n一起出发。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A little window into your friends’ worlds, wherever life takes you.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "无论身在何处，看看好友所在的城市。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Get a notification when you and a friend are in the same city. Make time to catch up.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "和好友来到同一座城市时，收到提醒，找时间见一面。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Make a shared trip, invite your friends, and see everyone’s flights in one place.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "创建行程、邀请好友，一起查看大家的航班。"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "Flight planning reminders": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "机票安排提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A reminder at 9 AM in your local time, plus occasional nudges from this trip's members, until you add an outbound flight. Stops when the trip starts. Notifications must be enabled.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "在你所在地时间每天上午 9 点提醒，也可接收行程成员发来的提醒。添加去程航班或行程开始后停止。需开启系统通知。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Remind": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "提醒一下"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Reminded": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "已提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Already reminded": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "今天已提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Remind %@ to add a flight": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "提醒 %@ 添加航班"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Flight reminder": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "机票提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A reminder isn’t available right now. They may have added a flight or may not be receiving reminders.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "暂时无法提醒，对方可能已添加航班或未开启提醒。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Couldn’t send the reminder. Please try again.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未能发出提醒，请重试。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Notifications couldn’t be enabled. Try again.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未能开启通知，请重试。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Notifications need attention": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "通知需要重新设置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Couldn’t enable notifications. Check your connection and try again.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未能开启通知，请检查网络后重试。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Cancel trip": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "取消行程"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Delete trip": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "删除行程"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Leave trip": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "退出行程"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Remove member": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "移除成员"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep trip": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "保留行程"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep member": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "保留成员"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Cancel this trip?": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "要取消这个行程吗？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Delete this trip for everyone?": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "要为所有成员删除这个行程吗？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Leave this trip?": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "要退出这个行程吗？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Remove this member?": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "要移除这位成员吗？"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Trip people": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "行程成员"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Trip cancelled · Read-only": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "行程已取消 · 仅供查看"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Trip cancelled": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "行程已取消"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Cancelled": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "已取消"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "People and flights are kept for reference. Updates have stopped.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "成员和航班记录已保留供查看，动态更新已停止。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Everyone will see this trip as cancelled in Past. Records are kept, but editing, invitations and flight alerts stop. This does not cancel airline reservations.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "所有成员都会在「过去的行程」中看到此行程已取消。记录会保留，但编辑、邀请和航班提醒将停止。这不会取消航空公司的机票预订。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "This permanently deletes the trip, shared flights and invitations for everyone. This cannot be undone and does not cancel airline reservations.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "这会为所有成员永久删除行程、共享航班和邀请。此操作无法撤销，也不会取消航空公司的机票预订。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Your flights will be removed from this trip and you will lose access and stop receiving its alerts. You will need a new invitation to rejoin.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "你的航班将从此行程中移除，你将无法继续访问，也不会再收到此行程的提醒。重新加入需要新的邀请。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "%@ will lose access to this trip. Their shared flights will be removed, and they will need a new invitation to rejoin.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "%@ 将无法继续访问此行程。对方的共享航班会被移除，重新加入需要新的邀请。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Remove %@": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "移除 %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The member could not be removed. Refresh and try again.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未能移除成员，请刷新后重试。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The trip change was not confirmed.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "尚未确认行程更改。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The trip change wasn’t confirmed. Refresh or retry when connected. %@": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "尚未确认行程更改，请联网后刷新或重试。%@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
